'''Cutting Edge''' (人工知能, ''Jinkō Chinō'', '''Artificial Intelligence''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (Sm): Cats' movement speed increases by 10%.

